le_name": "ss3.png", "id": "2250503891965287", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035334_2250503895298620_6069743772748061378_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gJjwkdeKQNAQ7kNvwHAgSoK&_nc_oc=AdlzuSZ6oL1f9x3ZQmwG-VwR4tB7wrVsVyKrdmG2K2Tu_TWxltxkJE5gGVIxzGPLrxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzSYS2PkUsIC2SOZ4utVqPMeo_Q7-ZcDw4_6qKbNFVTQg&oe=69BFE65E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1819228061920273", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_1819228065253606_407037206585227872_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jLISobuY7oEQ7kNvwGStjji&_nc_oc=AdmtRkPuJ2074Jt_0XRps_610kIfFex80Bbi1HCuxJxP36T1HKOpfZLBmmO1461KXu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwnwj3ibvyFyoMUDiPc_QYMuYiTM_A0R6sO9jLwsyHJvw&oe=69BFFBCA"}, "display_name": "Pinfall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Pinfall\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport.\nGame Overview\n\n\"Pinfall\" is a cutting-edge VR game that redefines the bowling experience by placing players in a vibrant cosmic arena. The game challenges your precision, skill, and timing as you aim to score points by knocking down pins in various celestial-themed lanes. Each game session offers a unique adventure, filled with stunning visuals and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark o